          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Abdomen soft and non-distended. No tenderness, including suprapubic tenderness, on superficial or deep palpation; no reproducible tenderness where the patient indicated. No masses or organomegaly; bladder not palpable; no costovertebral angle tenderness."
      }
    },
    {
